                    {
                        "form_id": "7e3fa4df-96f5-4cf8-bb6a-0c050ed2df55",
                        "entry_id": "410120e1-9c5e-31c9-ba55-e7555f2b5732",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "сермя́гах"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2ffaf79a-fcca-33e4-a40a-b3eba9ee701c",
                        "entry_id": "410120e1-9c5e-31c9-ba55-e7555f2b5732",
                        "glosses": [
                            "устар. грубое, некрашеное крестьянское сукно"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "28520fe6-e353-4f43-a87a-aedac792ab61",
                                "sense_id": "2ffaf79a-fcca-33e4-a40a-b3eba9ee701c",
                                "text": "И он торопливо оделся, положил в карман секундомер, накинул на плечи зипун из простой сермяги, вышел на цыпочках из избы и, наказав Никитке шагу не отлучаться от Грозного, скрылся в темноте, по направлению к дистанции."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ed174665-fdfa-3ef7-aa4e-d5bfd541fa02",
                        "entry_id": "410120e1-9c5e-31c9-ba55-e7555f2b5732",
                        "glosses": [
                            "устар. простой кафтан, крестьянская верхняя одежда из сермяги [1]"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "18eb3732-4210-4b6c-bb41-9c58c1cf98cd",
                                "sense_id": "ed174665-fdfa-3ef7-aa4e-d5bfd541fa02",
                                "text": "Гаврила Иваныч оделся: надел сперва сапоги, обернув предварительно ноги онучами, потом сермягу, опоясался кушаком, за пазуху положил кисет с махоркой, кремнем, плашкой и трутом и взял шапку."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "757133a9-acc2-4cb9-87ca-37f321b14ea1",
                                "sense_id": "ed174665-fdfa-3ef7-aa4e-d5bfd541fa02",
                                "text": "С тех пор мне казалось, что сермяги нищих пахнут не хлебом и пылью дорог, а порохом и гарью."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "20f08447-ce1e-45bf-95ee-1dcb33bdd8ad",
                                "sense_id": "ed174665-fdfa-3ef7-aa4e-d5bfd541fa02",
                                "text": "В толпе были старики в серых сермягах, на палящем солнце переходившие от кучки к кучке за слухами и сведениями."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f914cb81-ab37-3bf8-8be7-f506dc1e43d2",
                        "entry_id": "410120e1-9c5e-31c9-ba55-e7555f2b5732",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен., неол., жарг. грубая правда, нечто, вызывающее уважение своей простотой и подлинностью"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2e013ba9-9c0b-40a9-9951-853e823131f6",
                                "sense_id": "f914cb81-ab37-3bf8-8be7-f506dc1e43d2",
                                "text": "Читать эту книгу тяжело просто физически, настолько негладок язык, но есть, есть в ней сермяга, граждане."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0f35272b-9bea-3aa5-a141-58d8030ab768",
                        "entry_id": "410120e1-9c5e-31c9-ba55-e7555f2b5732",
                        "glosses": [
                            "жарг., крим. бедняк"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a3a99d5d-3fff-3f02-b294-eee99ff214ef",
                        "entry_id": "410120e1-9c5e-31c9-ba55-e7555f2b5732",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен. рутина, серая повседневность, беспросветность"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e4240da9-121a-4c81-a45a-65e56630f8cf",
                        "source_entry_id": "410120e1-9c5e-31c9-ba55-e7555f2b5732",
                        "source_sense_description": "сукно",
                        "target_lang_word": "coarse",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "coarse",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9edc6a47-ed79-322b-8e0b-15a1e7149fb7",
                                        "entry_id": "36adcb73-7132-34d8-ae87-5361efcbf6af",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "With a rough texture; not smooth."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "deec84d0-a8a1-4051-ae8f-abe7347bbe02",
                                                "sense_id": "9edc6a47-ed79-322b-8e0b-15a1e7149fb7",
                                                "text": "Two hundred Sempſtreſſes were employed to make me Shirts, and Linen for Bed and Table, all of the ſtrongeft and coarſeſt kind they could get; which, however, they were forced to quilt together in ſeveral Folds, for the thickeſt was ſome degrees finer than Lawn."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "27950844-b66e-34ec-8329-27bb69e740f2",
                                        "entry_id": "36adcb73-7132-34d8-ae87-5361efcbf6af",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Composed of large particles."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "00b53f9c-2a13-4bba-bae0-3afedf884cad",
                                                "sense_id": "27950844-b66e-34ec-8329-27bb69e740f2",
                                                "text": "coarse sand"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d683dc5-f9e5-4905-ab08-45378d2af6f9",
                                                "sense_id": "27950844-b66e-34ec-8329-27bb69e740f2",
                                                "text": "Graham flour is coarsely granulated wheat meal. No sieves or bolting cloths are employed in its manufacture, and many coarse, unpulverized particles are present in the product."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b8cfe1d2-2c4d-414a-98da-ba940b2f1da7",
                                                "sense_id": "27950844-b66e-34ec-8329-27bb69e740f2",
                                                "text": "Missing units may be attributed to either the lack of proper sized material in the source or the successive, downcurrent sedimentation of the coarser materials first and the finer materials last."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b9d44d00-330d-3bd1-afd0-e56001cbff0e",
                                        "entry_id": "36adcb73-7132-34d8-ae87-5361efcbf6af",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Lacking refinement, taste or delicacy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df9e8950-f455-42a1-aba1-9c06342d7d3f",
                                                "sense_id": "b9d44d00-330d-3bd1-afd0-e56001cbff0e",
                                                "text": "coarse manners"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "053dc926-8a44-4ed5-81aa-3c61b3f90979",
                                                "sense_id": "b9d44d00-330d-3bd1-afd0-e56001cbff0e",
                                                "text": "coarse language"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "11685741-b5b9-40e3-bd4d-ec4f9cccbff1",
                                                "sense_id": "b9d44d00-330d-3bd1-afd0-e56001cbff0e",
                                                "text": "☞ This word [earth] is liable to a coarſe vulgar pronunciation, as if written Urth;[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5e47ac51-8b34-462d-b9b0-d913f9285165",
                                                "sense_id": "b9d44d00-330d-3bd1-afd0-e56001cbff0e",
                                                "text": "The butcher and the porkman painted up only the leanest scrags of meat; the baker, the coarsest of meagre loaves."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ee94981e-58fa-3806-8ba0-2c1bab5737bd",
                                        "entry_id": "36adcb73-7132-34d8-ae87-5361efcbf6af",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Unrefined."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "98c7ae30-d288-384c-9eda-2bb95b70f704",
                                        "entry_id": "36adcb73-7132-34d8-ae87-5361efcbf6af",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of inferior quality."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "595f3c14-a338-43c6-983d-23ce618ab259",
                                                "sense_id": "98c7ae30-d288-384c-9eda-2bb95b70f704",
                                                "text": "Due to the internet issue, the system generated an coarse audio file."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2646f775-21c9-49d4-b7d9-5309f2799c6a",
                                                "sense_id": "98c7ae30-d288-384c-9eda-2bb95b70f704",
                                                "text": "She detests visiting coarse places."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f23ae64c-d6c4-4f5f-a3bd-816d3b8bba0e",
                        "source_entry_id": "410120e1-9c5e-31c9-ba55-e7555f2b5732",
                        "source_sense_description": "одежда",
                        "target_lang_word": "caftan",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "caftan",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "11488cb2-5357-3fdb-803b-2a659cd8359d",
                                        "entry_id": "97d6c648-6813-3343-adb1-6ca7d7c27401",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative spelling of kaftan."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7d7be78e-f313-41bb-8d85-7f2d682f75f1",
                                                "sense_id": "11488cb2-5357-3fdb-803b-2a659cd8359d",
                                                "text": "From the pocket of her discarded caftan she lifted a thick medallion and set it in place around her neck."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2f812488-2e7c-4da6-9e68-ccfa0151094b",
                                                "sense_id": "11488cb2-5357-3fdb-803b-2a659cd8359d",
                                                "text": "Still, he did look striking in his long white flowing pants and a white caftan."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "635ddf23-5e81-4e86-b28c-a1b337f6a907",
                                                "sense_id": "11488cb2-5357-3fdb-803b-2a659cd8359d",
                                                "text": "[…] there’s always “The Golden Girls.” Less couture, more caftans; less Gramercy Park townhouses, more Miami ranch houses, but all the joy and laughs that “And Just Like That …” didn’t deliver."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
